// ================= MAP VIEW: every StrollTO stroll on a map of Toronto =================
// City stroll points: City of Toronto StrollTO open data (COT_StrollTO_details, fetched 7 Oct 2026).
// Base map (shoreline, islands, major streets, subway and LRT lines with stations, streetcar routes):
// the StrollTO transit map's embedded geometry. Line 5 and 6 stations and all positions are approximate.
// Reachability follows the transit map: straight-line distance x 1.4, walking at 1.3 m/s,
// "in walking range" = a station or streetcar within 1,500 m.
var MAP_SPEED = 1.3, MAP_DETOUR = 1.4, MAP_RANGE_M = 1500;
var MAP_W = 375, MAP_SHEET = 300;
var STROLLTO_URL = 'https://www.toronto.ca/services-payments/streets-parking-transportation/sidewalk-tours-wayfinding/self-guided-tours/strollto/about-strollto/';
